			<TRAN name="obcsb_efif_162r" title="전자금융ID와비밀번호일치체크" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="89" _ulen="69" >

ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
CONN_PWD^접속비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

