SUCS_YN^성공여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obcsb_info_004r" title="입력유형별 고객번호 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="165" _ulen="125" >

ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
RRNO^주민등록번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
RRNO_PIP^주민등록번호PIP^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="71" _ulen="57" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNM^고객명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
	</DATAIO_INFO>
